  "contentHtml": "<figure class=\"notion-image-figure\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/notion/pelajaran-Personal-pronouns-block-1.png\" alt=\"Article illustration\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          \n        </figure>\n<h1 id=\"1-apa-itu-personal-pronouns-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">1. 🧠 Apa itu Personal Pronouns?</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>Personal Pronouns</strong> adalah kata yang digunakan untuk <strong>menggantikan nama orang, hewan, atau benda</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\">👦 <strong>Andi is a student. He is smart.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Andi adalah seorang siswa. <strong>Dia</strong> pintar.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Kata <strong>He</strong> digunakan untuk menggantikan <strong>Andi</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👉 Jadi, kita tidak perlu menyebut nama <strong>Andi</strong> berulang-ulang.</p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"2-jenis-jenis-personal-pronouns-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">2. 👥 Jenis-Jenis Personal Pronouns</h1>\n<div class=\"notion-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"notion-table\"><tr class=\"notion-table-header-row\"><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">Pronoun</th><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">Arti</th><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">Digunakan untuk</th></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>I</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">saya/aku</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">diri sendiri</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>You</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">kamu/kalian</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">orang yang diajak bicara</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>He</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">dia</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">satu laki-laki</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>She</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">dia</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">satu perempuan</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>It</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">itu/dia</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">satu benda atau hewan</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>We</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">kami/kita</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">saya + orang lain</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>They</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">mereka</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">lebih dari satu orang/benda</td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧩 Cara mudah mengingat</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👤 <strong>I</strong> → saya</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👉 <strong>You</strong> → kamu/kalian</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👦 <strong>He</strong> → dia laki-laki</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👧 <strong>She</strong> → dia perempuan</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🐱📕 <strong>It</strong> → benda/hewan</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👥 <strong>We</strong> → kami/kita</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👥👥 <strong>They</strong> → mereka</p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"3-i-saya-aku-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">3. 👤 I = Saya / Aku</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>I</strong> digunakan ketika kita berbicara tentang <strong>diri sendiri</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>I am a student.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Saya adalah seorang siswa.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>I like English.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Saya suka Bahasa Inggris.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>I am happy.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Saya senang.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>I = saya/aku</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"4-you-kamu-kalian-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">4. 👉 You = Kamu / Kalian</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>You</strong> digunakan untuk orang yang <strong>kita ajak berbicara</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>You are my friend.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Kamu adalah teman saya.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>You are a student.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Kamu adalah seorang siswa.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>You</strong> juga dapat digunakan untuk lebih dari satu orang.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>You are good students.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Kalian adalah siswa yang baik.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>You = kamu atau kalian</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"5-he-dia-laki-laki-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">5. 👦 He = Dia Laki-Laki</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>He</strong> digunakan untuk <strong>satu orang laki-laki</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>Budi is my friend. He is kind.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Budi adalah teman saya. <strong>Dia</strong> baik.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>Mr. John is a teacher. He is smart.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Pak John adalah seorang guru. <strong>Dia</strong> pintar.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👦 <strong>He = dia laki-laki</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"6-she-dia-perempuan-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">6. 👧 She = Dia Perempuan</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>She</strong> digunakan untuk <strong>satu orang perempuan</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>Siti is my sister. She is kind.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Siti adalah saudara perempuan saya. <strong>Dia</strong> baik.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>Mrs. Lina is a teacher. She is nice.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Bu Lina adalah seorang guru. <strong>Dia</strong> baik.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">👧 <strong>She = dia perempuan</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"7-it-itu-dia-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">7. 🐱 It = Itu / Dia</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>It</strong> digunakan untuk <strong>satu benda atau satu hewan</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh benda:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>This is a book. It is new.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Ini adalah sebuah buku. <strong>Buku itu</strong> baru.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh hewan:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>This is a cat. It is cute.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Ini adalah seekor kucing. <strong>Kucing itu</strong> lucu.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🐱📕 <strong>It = satu benda atau satu hewan</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"8-we-kami-kita-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">8. 👥 We = Kami / Kita</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>We</strong> digunakan untuk <strong>saya dan orang lain</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>My friend and I are students. We are classmates.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Teman saya dan saya adalah siswa. <strong>Kami</strong> adalah teman sekelas.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>My brother and I play football. We are happy.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Saudara laki-laki saya dan saya bermain sepak bola. <strong>Kami</strong> senang.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>We = saya + orang lain</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"9-they-mereka-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">9. 👥👥 They = Mereka</h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>They</strong> digunakan untuk <strong>dua orang atau lebih</strong>, atau beberapa benda.</p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh orang:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>Andi and Budi are friends. They are students.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Andi dan Budi adalah teman. <strong>Mereka</strong> adalah siswa.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">Contoh benda:</p>\n<blockquote class=\"notion-quote\">\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-text\"><strong>These are books. They are new.</strong></div>\n          <div class=\"notion-quote-children\"><p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🇮🇩 Ini adalah buku-buku. <strong>Buku-buku itu</strong> baru.</p>\n</div>\n        </blockquote>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 <strong>Ingat:</strong></p>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\"><strong>They = mereka / beberapa benda</strong></p>\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<h1 id=\"10-ringkasan-personal-pronouns-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\"><strong>10. 🌟 Ringkasan Personal Pronouns</strong></h1>\n<p class=\"notion-paragraph\">🧠 Hafalkan dengan pola ini:</p>\n<div class=\"notion-table-wrapper\"><table class=\"notion-table\"><tr class=\"notion-table-header-row\"><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">👤 Pronoun</th><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">🇮🇩 Arti</th><th class=\"notion-table-cell\">🔎 Petunjuk</th></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>I</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">saya/aku</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">diri sendiri</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>You</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">kamu/kalian</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">lawan bicara</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>He</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">dia</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">👦 laki-laki</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>She</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">dia</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">👧 perempuan</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>It</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">itu/dia</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">🐱📕 benda/hewan</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>We</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">kami/kita</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">👤 + orang lain</td></tr><tr class=\"notion-table-row\"><td class=\"notion-table-cell\"><strong>They</strong></td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">mereka</td><td class=\"notion-table-cell\">👥 lebih dari satu</td></tr></table></div>\n<hr class=\"notion-divider\" />\n<h1 id=\"tugas-latihan-3f89\" class=\"notion-h1\">Tugas latihan</h1>\n<div class=\"notion-embed-card\">\n          <iframe src=\"https://tally.so/embed/pbg4Vb?alignLeft=1&amp;hideTitle=1&amp;transparentBackground=1&amp;dynamicHeight=1\" class=\"notion-embed-iframe\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe>\n          <div class=\"notion-embed-footer\">\n            <span class=\"notion-embed-label\">⚡ Interactive Embed Preview</span>\n            <a href=\"https://tally.so/embed/pbg4Vb?alignLeft=1&amp;hideTitle=1&amp;transparentBackground=1&amp;dynamicHeight=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"notion-embed-open\">↗ Buka Layar Penuh (https://tally.so/embed/pbg4Vb?alignLeft=1&amp;hideTitle=1&amp;transparentBackground=1&amp;dynamicHeight=1)</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n<hr class=\"notion-divider\" />\n<div class=\"notion-blank-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n",
